35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Transport is 38% of costs if we go far. Public beds are cheap at 1,100 yen.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Inland clubs slept eight to a room. Cooking duty took two hours daily last year.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minako,,Seniors say mixing only happens in shared evenings. A fifth of members never attended.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,Our hall is booked by others. Public bookings require a six-month lottery.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,Whole-building lets have non-refundable deposits. A third of members can't arrive by nine.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, if we avoid cooking, does that solve the duty issue?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"Yes, but the inland option has strict lights-out and crowded rooms.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Jonathan, if the hall is unavailable, we must go away to train properly.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,The lottery is risky. We need a guaranteed booking to ensure sleep quality.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, the transport cost is high, but the coastal lodge might be cheaper overall?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The coastal lodge offers a whole building. We need to check the deposit terms.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"If we go coastal, we avoid the inland dormitory issues and the cooking duty.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minako,,"A coastal lodge allows for shared evenings, which helps year-group mixing.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,A private building ensures better sleep than the crowded public dorms.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"The non-refundable deposit is a risk, but the flat fee might be simpler.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I am leaning towards the coastal option to control costs and duties.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. It avoids the worst of the inland and campus options.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minako,,It supports the social goals we need for retention.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,It offers the best chance for adequate rest and focused training.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,The financial risk is manageable if we set clear cancellation policies.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
